  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Foundation for Civil Society (FCS), contributing to domestic accountability in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Foundation for Civil Society (FCS), contributing to domestic accountability in Tanzania is a component of Grassroots Empowerment in Tanzania (GET) Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,994,962. It works in the following sector(s): Democratic participation and civil society, Media and free flow of information, Human rights, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions.</narrative>
